# What this release was actually exercised against (#42).
#
# The FINDINGS discipline, surfaced to users instead of buried in docs: every
# claim this project makes was measured on one combination, and a user on a
# different one is in untested territory and deserves to be told so rather than
# to discover it as a title that will not sign in.
#
# Dot-sourced by deploy.sh into the receipt, and read back by the launcher's
# diagnose pane. Update it when a release is cut and re-exercised.
